@startuml
title Gauss4 guiding-center capability contract

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component Potential
component GuidingCenterDynamics
component GaussLegendre4
component "Dense centered differences" as FiniteDifference
component "Generalized-energy diagnostics" as Energy

Potential --> GuidingCenterDynamics : sampled H(t,x,y)
GuidingCenterDynamics --> GaussLegendre4 : vector_field(t,z)
GuidingCenterDynamics --> GaussLegendre4 : particle_vector_field_jacobians(t,z)\nN x 2 x 2
GuidingCenterDynamics --> FiniteDifference : vector_field when exact blocks are unavailable
FiniteDifference --> GaussLegendre4 : dense stage Jacobians
GuidingCenterDynamics --> Energy : hamiltonian(t,z)\nextended_momentum_derivative(t,z)
GaussLegendre4 --> Energy : physical history and k history

note right of GaussLegendre4
  Auto probes the analytic capability.
  Analytic path:
  N independent 4 x 4
  Newton systems
end note

@enduml
